ck! \n      tw:p-0\n      tw:m-0\n      tw:transition-[max-height] \n      tw:duration-500 \n      tw:ease-in-out \n      tw:group-[.is-closed]:max-h-0! \n      tw:group-[.is-wrap]:text-wrap\n      tw:overflow-y-hidden\n      tw:overflow-x-auto\n      tw:scrollbar-thin\n      \"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"nc\"\u003eHelloPhoenixWeb.Router.Helpers\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"o\"\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"n\"\u003epage_path\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"p\"\u003e(\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"nc\"\u003eHelloPhoenixWeb.Endpoint\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"p\"\u003e,\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"ss\"\u003e:index\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"p\"\u003e)\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"c1\"\u003e# \u0026#34;/\u0026#34;\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"nc\"\u003eHelloPhoenixWeb.Router.Helpers\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"o\"\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"n\"\u003ehello_path\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"p\"\u003e(\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"nc\"\u003eHelloPhoenixWeb.Endpoint\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"p\"\u003e,\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"ss\"\u003e:index\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"p\"\u003e)\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"c1\"\u003e# \u0026#34;/hello\u0026#34;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHelps 也可以用在 eex 中，示例 \u003ccode\u003epage_path(@conn, :index)\u003c/code\u003e 的输出即为 \u003ccode\u003e\u0026quot;/\u0026quot;\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"code-block highlight is-open show-line-numbers  tw:group tw:my-2\"\u003e\n  \u003cdiv class=\"\n    \n    tw:flex \n    tw:flex-row\n    tw:flex-1 \n    tw:justify-between \n    tw:w-full tw:bg-bgColor-secondary\n    \"\u003e      \n    \u003cbutton \n      class=